#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:34 index.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kworldclock; is an application that shows which parts of the world are "
"currently experiencing daylight, and which parts are currently in night. It "
"also shows the current time in a range of cities around the world."
msgstr ""

